@host = http://localhost:5193
@token = paste-jwt-access-token-here

### Public storefront product list
GET {{host}}/api/storefront/products
Accept: application/json

### Log in and copy the access token into @token
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@clothic.example",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Authenticated orders list
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
